<report>
<title>General agreement over all (@cats) categories with @r raters per subject</title>

<p>Cohen's kappa (Landis-Koch extension):</p>

<table>
<tr><th>Response</th><th>Kappa</th><th>se</th><th>z(for k=0)</th><th>Probability</th></tr>
<block name="cats"><tr><td>@resp</td><td>@{k:roundu}</td><td>@{se:roundu}</td><td>@{z:roundu}</td><td><pval>@{p:pval}</pval></td></tr></block>
</table>

<p><u>Combined (Fleiss-Nee-Landis test)</u><br />
Kappa = @{kc:roundu}<br />
@{pc:round2}% CI: @{ll:roundu} to @{ul:roundu}<br />
z (for k = 0) = @{zc:roundu}<br />
<pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>

</report>
